    {"type": "text", "id": "fe_ws_code", "x": 112, "y": 484, "width": 364, "height": 128, "text": "useWebSocket（30s 心跳 · 指数退避重连）\n下行事件流驱动 UI：\nmessage_start   开始一轮分析\nmessage_delta  模型增量文本\n tool_start / tool_finish  工具执行\nresult_ready → GET /results/{id}\ndone · 4401 重取令牌 · 4408 重连", "originalText": "useWebSocket（30s 心跳 · 指数退避重连）\n下行事件流驱动 UI：\nmessage_start   开始一轮分析\nmessage_delta  模型增量文本\n tool_start / tool_finish  工具执行\nresult_ready → GET /results/{id}\ndone · 4401 重取令牌 · 4408 重连", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200023, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200024, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25},
