    {"type": "text", "id": "be_sql_ev_t", "x": 116, "y": 1068, "width": 712, "height": 84, "text": "sql_query 安全约束（语句级只读，错误码 50002）\n① 首词白名单：SELECT / WITH / SHOW / DESCRIBE\n② 关键词黑名单：INSERT·UPDATE·DELETE·DROP·ATTACH…（词边界匹配）\n③ 强制包裹 LIMIT 1000  ④ 单语句 10s 超时  ⑤ 禁多语句（分号检测）", "originalText": "sql_query 安全约束（语句级只读，错误码 50002）\n① 首词白名单：SELECT / WITH / SHOW / DESCRIBE\n② 关键词黑名单：INSERT·UPDATE·DELETE·DROP·ATTACH…（词边界匹配）\n③ 强制包裹 LIMIT 1000  ④ 单语句 10s 超时  ⑤ 禁多语句（分号检测）", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 300085, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 300086, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25},
